1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,900
People ask me, "How we doing?"

2
00:00:02,900 --> 00:00:07,940
I tell 'em, "Well, I woke up, so no complaints"

3
00:00:07,940 --> 00:00:12,100
And I ask 'em, "So tell me, how we doing?"

4
00:00:12,100 --> 00:00:14,420
And here's the secret

5
00:00:14,420 --> 00:00:18,500
Their mind goes looking for something good to tell me

6
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:20,820
And it finds it

7
00:00:21,060 --> 00:00:22,880
Every single time

8
00:00:22,880 --> 00:00:26,100
They just had a little better day

9
00:00:26,100 --> 00:00:29,380
And they never even knew I did that

10
00:00:29,380 --> 00:00:30,180
Now you know

11
00:00:30,180 --> 00:00:31,140
You're welcome

12
00:00:31,140 --> 00:00:32,040
Folks ask me what I'd give anything to do one more time
